Subject: [PATCH] dts: msm8952: match APQ8017 on QRD SKU5

Bootstrap patch for lk2nd 517bb38a409d4ac982f09e83a046e4dc71be5029.

The Wi-Fi Lenovo TB-X304F reports APQ8017 (SoC ID 307), QRD SKU5
board ID 0x1000b, and the NT35521S panel already handled by this DT.
Keep the existing MSM8917 match and add the Wi-Fi SoC. This does not
change or replace the signed stock bootloader.

diff --git a/lk2nd/device/dts/msm8952/msm8917-qrd-sku5.dts b/lk2nd/device/dts/msm8952/msm8917-qrd-sku5.dts
--- a/lk2nd/device/dts/msm8952/msm8917-qrd-sku5.dts
+++ b/lk2nd/device/dts/msm8952/msm8917-qrd-sku5.dts
@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@
 #include <dt-bindings/lk2nd/regulator.h>
 
 / {
-	qcom,msm-id = <QCOM_ID_MSM8917 0>;
+	qcom,msm-id = <QCOM_ID_MSM8917 0>, <QCOM_ID_APQ8017 0>;
 	qcom,board-id = <QCOM_BOARD_ID(QRD, 1, 0) 0>;
 };
 
